    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong> is a couch/online arcade action game where fearless pilots battling in chaotic aerial arenas across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just here to mess around with friends or to show off your next-level piloting skills, this game has room for both. The controls are easy to pick up, but mastering the skies? That\u2019s a whole different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/d81617a89c0f3840d2f5df9af8697bdb.poster.avif?t=1753655736\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/d81617a89c0f3840d2f5df9af8697bdb.webm?t=1753655736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/d81617a89c0f3840d2f5df9af8697bdb.mp4?t=1753655736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual fun or competitive flair \u2014 the choice is yours. Just don\u2019t expect anything to go as planned once you're <strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local/online multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique pilots &amp; flying machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ weapons: bullets, rockets, lasers, mines and other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactable arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible arcade-style controls with skill-based depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful, stylized world that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for party nights <i>or</i> sweaty 1v1 grudge matches</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong> is a couch/online arcade action game where fearless pilots battling in chaotic aerial arenas across the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're just here to mess around with friends or to show off your next-level piloting skills, this game has room for both. The controls are easy to pick up, but mastering the skies? That\u2019s a whole different story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/d81617a89c0f3840d2f5df9af8697bdb.poster.avif?t=1753655736\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/d81617a89c0f3840d2f5df9af8697bdb.webm?t=1753655736\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752960/extras/d81617a89c0f3840d2f5df9af8697bdb.mp4?t=1753655736\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual fun or competitive flair \u2014 the choice is yours. Just don\u2019t expect anything to go as planned once you're <strong>Off the Beaten Track</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local/online multiplayer for up to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique pilots &amp; flying machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ weapons: bullets, rockets, lasers, mines and other</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 interactable arenas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible arcade-style controls with skill-based depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playful, stylized world that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for party nights <i>or</i> sweaty 1v1 grudge matches</p></li></ul>",
